// ---------- Pricing ----------

const pricingHeading = "SEO and website prices for businesses in Japan";
const pricingIntro = `Our plans are priced in US dollars; the yen column uses ¥${JPY_PER_USD} to the dollar purely as a reference point against Japanese SEO quotes. For search work the relevant rows are Monthly SEO and the SEO website, but the whole list is shown because SEO often leads to changes on the site itself. Each figure is where a written scope starts, and a yen invoice can be arranged.`;
const pricingFine = `These figures open the conversation; your quote sets the final number. The yen column is indicative only (¥${JPY_PER_USD} to the dollar), and the agreed amount in USD or JPY is written into the quote. Native writers, translators, any paid SEO tools held in your name, domains, hosting and ad spend are paid by you to those providers. No Japanese consumption tax is added to our invoices.`;

// ---------- Regions: one source for the guide blocks and the region table ----------

